          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "вкладывать (vkládyvat) is built from в- \"in\" and the root of класть \"to lay\", inherited from Proto-Slavic klasti: to lay money into something."
            }
